(footprint "Hirose_DM3D-SF"
  (version 20240108)
  (generator "custom")
  (generator_version "1.0")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Hirose DM3D-SF microSD card connector (HRS 609-0025-8), push-pull, top-mount, body 11.95x11.45 mm. Drawn from the 'Recommended PCB mounting pattern' + connector drawing in the Hirose DM3 Series datasheet (DM3D-SF): 8 contacts 0.7x1.75 mm on 1.1 mm pitch, pin 1 (DAT2) at the +X end of the contact row (front-elevation leader labels: 8=DAT1 at -X end ... 1=DAT2 at +X end); card-detection switch (normally open, closes with card inserted): pad 9 = switch (A), pad 10 = switch (B) per the top-view leaders; 4 shell solder tabs = MP. Card inserts from the +Y edge (contact-row side). Origin = connector body centre. Geometry extracted from the datasheet drawing's vector outlines and cross-checked on a 700-dpi render (scale 8.3052 pt/mm from the labelled 1.1 mm pitch / 7.7 mm span); all values rounded to 0.01 mm. Note-3 'no conductive traces' zones are drawn on F.Fab for reference only. VERIFY against a physical connector before fabrication - see dm3d-sf-footprint-notes.md.")
  (tags "Hirose DM3D-SF microSD card connector DM3")
